M5Stack NanoC6 Aliro NFC Reader

This project contains a patch derived from and intended for Espressif's
esp-matter door-lock example:
https://github.com/espressif/esp-matter

It also depends on Espressif's esp-aliro project and the M5Stack Unit NFC
component:
https://github.com/espressif/esp-aliro
https://github.com/m5stack/M5Unit-NFC

